# Cloudflare Pages redirects, copied to the site's root by `just cf_stage`
# Minard, the homage to Minard's map of the 1812 campaign, lives on its own site
/minard https://minard1812.org/ 301
/minard/ https://minard1812.org/ 301
/minard/* https://minard1812.org/:splat 301

# The book lives under /doc/, but its page data holds addresses without that base (/api/implot, /api.implot.index.json):
